# Realization

Realization and machine work must preserve graph meaning and report exactly
which path is exercised: direct native, generated C, Wasm, runtime, benchmark,
or external oracle. Read `docs/performance.md` before performance claims.

Do not select meaning from callee text, backend shape, opcode, hash, or artifact
layout. A faster or smaller result is not semantic authority.
